<urn:atm:triage:finding/ATM-QA-005-AK7-ENVGUARD-NOOP>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ATM-QA-005-AK7-ENVGUARD-NOOP" ;
  triage:title "ATM_ENVIRONMENT hostile value added to doctor test EnvGuard asserts nothing, since DoctorExecutionContext has no environment field" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-daemon/src/tests.rs:919 sets a hostile ATM_ENVIRONMENT value in doctor_client_context_reflects_caller_over_daemon_launch_environment's EnvGuard, but DoctorExecutionContext (crates/atm-core/src/doctor/report.rs:54-65) has no environment field, so nothing is actually asserted about it. The extension proves nothing new; not blocking because the struct's shape already makes the leak structurally impossible, but the test addition is a no-op that should either assert something meaningful or be removed from the hostile set." ;
